# Category: lexical, values, variables, operators, output
name is "Otter"          # inline comment
count1 is 3
ratio is 2.5
flag is true
other is false
nothing is gone
say "tab:\there" "quote:\"q\"" "slash:\\" "keep:\q"
say name count1 ratio flag other nothing
say
flipped is not flag
say flipped
notOther is not other
say notOther
neg is 0 minus 5
say neg
say 2 plus 3 times 4
say 10 - 4 / 2
say 1 + 2 * 3
say 7 divided by 2
say 20 percent of 50
say 2 power 10
joined is "Hello, " and name
say joined
sum is 10 and 20
say sum
5 plus 6 make eleven
say eleven
x is 4
x times 2 make y
say y
log "a log line"
warn "a warning"
error "an error line"
